  "body": "It seems like Matrix lacks features for anti-spamming. My community is encrypted and I can't add any bots unless I make some kind of script run an instance that detects spam behaviour.\r\n\r\nSo the idea is to have this integrated in the room options, it would benefit administrators a lot.\r\n\r\nThis temporary role would should have settings for how long it lasts. It could be from a couple of hours to a few days.",
